---
import {
  centralDifferenceKinetic,
  exactDimensionlessKinetic,
  finiteDifferenceDispersionRatio,
} from '../../../data/part04/ch12TeachingModels.mjs';

const defaultProbe = 1.2;
const makePath = (kind) => Array.from({ length: 181 }, (_, index) => {
  const kh = Math.PI * index / 180;
  const value = kind === 'exact' ? exactDimensionlessKinetic(kh) : centralDifferenceKinetic(kh);
  const x = 50 + 500 * index / 180;
  const y = 235 - 19 * value;
  return `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${y.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual fd-dispersion" data-fd-dispersion>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：二阶中心差分的数值色散</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: numerical dispersion of the second-order central difference</span>
  </figcaption>

  <label class="fd-dispersion__control">
    <span>探针波数 kh | Probe wave number kh</span>
    <input aria-label="Dimensionless grid wave number kh" type="range" min="0" max={Math.PI} step="0.01" value={defaultProbe} data-fd-probe />
    <output data-fd-probe-output>{defaultProbe.toFixed(2)}</output>
  </label>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fd-title fd-desc">
    <title id="fd-title">Exact and finite-difference kinetic eigenvalues</title>
    <desc id="fd-desc">Comparison of k h squared with two times one minus cosine k h from zero to the Nyquist edge pi.</desc>
    <line x1="50" y1="235" x2="550" y2="235" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="50" y1="35" x2="50" y2="235" class="plot-axis" />
    <path d={makePath('exact')} class="fd-dispersion__exact" />
    <path d={makePath('fd')} class="fd-dispersion__fd" />
    <line x1={50 + 500 * defaultProbe / Math.PI} x2={50 + 500 * defaultProbe / Math.PI} y1="35" y2="235" class="plot-guide" data-fd-line />
    <text x="550" y="265" text-anchor="end">kh</text>
    <text x="50" y="265">0</text>
    <text x="550" y="265" text-anchor="middle">π</text>
    <text x="16" y="42">λh²</text>
    <text x="360" y="72" class="fd-dispersion__label-exact">exact: (kh)²</text>
    <text x="360" y="160" class="fd-dispersion__label-fd">finite difference</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>离散/连续本征值比 | discrete/continuum eigenvalue ratio:</span>
    <strong data-fd-ratio>{finiteDifferenceDispersionRatio(defaultProbe).toFixed(4)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>对网格平面波 <code>exp(ikjh)</code>，连续 <code>−∂²/∂x²</code> 的无量纲本征值为 <code>(kh)²</code>；三点中心差分给出 <code>2[1−cos(kh)]</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> for the grid plane wave <code>exp(ikjh)</code>, the dimensionless eigenvalue of continuous <code>−∂²/∂x²</code> is <code>(kh)²</code>, whereas the three-point central difference gives <code>2[1−cos(kh)]</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>kh→0</code> 时两者比值趋于 1；Nyquist 边缘 <code>kh=π</code> 时比值为 <code>4/π²</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the ratio tends to 1 as <code>kh→0</code> and equals <code>4/π²</code> at the Nyquist edge <code>kh=π</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>图中只有一维均匀网格和二阶 stencil。高阶、Mehrstellen、有限元或自适应网格具有不同误差函数。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> only a one-dimensional uniform grid and a second-order stencil are represented. Higher-order, Mehrstellen, finite-element, and adaptive schemes have different error functions.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>JavaScript 已关闭：静态图仍给出完整区间的连续与离散色散曲线。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-fd-dispersion]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-fd-probe]');
    const output = root.querySelector('[data-fd-probe-output]');
    const ratio = root.querySelector('[data-fd-ratio]');
    const line = root.querySelector('[data-fd-line]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(line instanceof SVGLineElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const kh = Number(input.value);
      const discrete = kh === 0 ? 1 : 2 * (1 - Math.cos(kh)) / (kh * kh);
      const x = 50 + 500 * kh / Math.PI;
      line.setAttribute('x1', String(x));
      line.setAttribute('x2', String(x));
      if (output instanceof HTMLOutputElement) output.value = kh.toFixed(2);
      if (ratio instanceof HTMLElement) ratio.textContent = discrete.toFixed(4);
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .fd-dispersion__control { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .fd-dispersion input, .fd-dispersion svg { width: 100%; }
  .fd-dispersion svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .fd-dispersion__exact, .fd-dispersion__fd { fill: none; stroke-width: 3; }
  .fd-dispersion__exact { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .fd-dispersion__fd { stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent); stroke-dasharray: 7 5; }
  .fd-dispersion__label-exact { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
</style>
